      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to see VRChat do a better job of communicating the statuses and instance type to users. I was in a \"friends\", no plus sign instance, and on green. So I got a request to join and the user interface gave me a choice to accept or not, but if I'm not the owner of a friend only instance it should have said something.\n\nIf I actually can't accept an invite request, I think the interface should tell me.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
